{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inkoid isn\u2019t your typical ground-based shooter. Here, the battlefield is the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take flight and unleash your ink to change the color\u2014and the control\u2014of the arena. Compete in intense 3v3 matches where two teams soar through vast arenas, using ink to capture key structures. The team that controls the most points when time runs out wins the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory isn\u2019t just about your aim\u2014it\u2019s about strategy, territory, and teamwork. Outsmart your opponents with vertical tactics, surprise attacks from above, and seamless coordination with your squad. In a world of color-soaked aerial combat, will you dominate the skies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Free-Flight Aerial Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the ground\u2014take to the skies! Soar freely through three-dimensional arenas. Control high ground, dive from above, and strike with precision to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/cdd1a031471fee95549ee2a221c938be.poster.avif?t=1768454744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/cdd1a031471fee95549ee2a221c938be.webm?t=1768454744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Strategic Structure Capture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kills aren\u2019t the goal\u2014control is. Splash your team\u2019s ink on key structures scattered throughout the map to claim them as your own. The team with the most captured zones at the end wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Team-Based 3v3 Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t win alone. Fly with your squad, communicate, coordinate, and conquer. Only those with true teamwork will claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 6 Unique Weapon Types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a weapon that fits your style and dominate the battlefield:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooter: Versatile rifle for all-around combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shotgun: Devastating at close range</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniper: Precision long-range firepower</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Homing Missiles: Smart missiles that chase down enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG: Rocket launcher with explosive area damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drill: Brutal melee weapon that tears through anything</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/893183ef490893377f4c18e21b4cf7a5.avif?t=1768454744\" width=330 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 8 Game-Changing Power Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use randomly appearing power-ups to turn the tide of battle:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Buff Items (for yourself):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited ink</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invincibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Debuff Items (against enemies):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obscure enemy vision</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrink enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Halve enemy ink capacity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow down enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reverse enemy controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/92756f35e764fa53e0aa3f8a3e717652.avif?t=1768454744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras_big/92756f35e764fa53e0aa3f8a3e717652.webp?t=1768454744 width=1560 height=1318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 5 Distinct Arenas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in three uniquely designed battlefields:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stadium: Splash ink across spaceships and planets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night City: Zip vertically through towering structures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pipe World: Dominate the winding interiors of massive pipes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/8c73186f57a8ddcf102dad7b6ec889f8.avif?t=1768454744\" width=1527 height=626 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/35a52679c2612185d2f3d4332f9b31c4.avif?t=1768454744\" width=1539 height=631 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/adc574a9e43b34cb78ab616642e29110.avif?t=1768454744\" width=1541 height=634 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/f76ed846be924d0c882a49ce92d84076.avif?t=1768454744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras_big/f76ed846be924d0c882a49ce92d84076.avif?t=1768454744 width=1560 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/dc1704c3035770fa74ab7c9b2a4abd33.avif?t=1768454744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras_big/dc1704c3035770fa74ab7c9b2a4abd33.avif?t=1768454744 width=1560 height=782 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 AI Battle Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice your skills or enjoy low-pressure matches by battling against AI bots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/93d1bd74bdbb60c516c3511604fba8d0.poster.avif?t=1768454744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/93d1bd74bdbb60c516c3511604fba8d0.webm?t=1768454744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/93d1bd74bdbb60c516c3511604fba8d0.mp4?t=1768454744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Customize Your Robot Pilot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into battle as a powerful robot pilot. Equip quirky and stylish hats to express your personality and stand out in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/84846004ec55bebd8e3743a9584433dc.avif?t=1768454744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras_big/84846004ec55bebd8e3743a9584433dc.avif?t=1768454744 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/a1452b14f98529a289c09168938d740f.poster.avif?t=1768454744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/a1452b14f98529a289c09168938d740f.webm?t=1768454744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/a1452b14f98529a289c09168938d740f.mp4?t=1768454744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4126470?t=1768454744","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/5a3be3f59237299013b3ca356ef12ebea31b5203/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768454744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/13cbb25b223b14eac97e848be38f879b74a070c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768454744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/13cbb25b223b14eac97e848be38f879b74a070c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768454744","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4148040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inkoid isn\u2019t your typical ground-based shooter. Here, the battlefield is the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take flight and unleash your ink to change the color\u2014and the control\u2014of the arena. Compete in intense 3v3 matches where two teams soar through vast arenas, using ink to capture key structures. The team that controls the most points when time runs out wins the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory isn\u2019t just about your aim\u2014it\u2019s about strategy, territory, and teamwork. Outsmart your opponents with vertical tactics, surprise attacks from above, and seamless coordination with your squad. In a world of color-soaked aerial combat, will you dominate the skies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Free-Flight Aerial Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the ground\u2014take to the skies! Soar freely through three-dimensional arenas. Control high ground, dive from above, and strike with precision to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/cdd1a031471fee95549ee2a221c938be.poster.avif?t=1768454744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/cdd1a031471fee95549ee2a221c938be.webm?t=1768454744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Strategic Structure Capture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kills aren\u2019t the goal\u2014control is. Splash your team\u2019s ink on key structures scattered throughout the map to claim them as your own. The team with the most captured zones at the end wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Team-Based 3v3 Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t win alone. Fly with your squad, communicate, coordinate, and conquer. Only those with true teamwork will claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 6 Unique Weapon Types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a weapon that fits your style and dominate the battlefield:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooter: Versatile rifle for all-around combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shotgun: Devastating at close range</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniper: Precision long-range firepower</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Homing Missiles: Smart missiles that chase down enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG: Rocket launcher with explosive area damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drill: Brutal melee weapon that tears through anything</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/893183ef490893377f4c18e21b4cf7a5.avif?t=1768454744\" width=330 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 8 Game-Changing Power Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use randomly appearing power-ups to turn the tide of battle:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Buff Items (for yourself):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited ink</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invincibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Debuff Items (against enemies):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obscure enemy vision</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrink enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Halve enemy ink capacity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow down enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reverse enemy controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/92756f35e764fa53e0aa3f8a3e717652.avif?t=1768454744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras_big/92756f35e764fa53e0aa3f8a3e717652.webp?t=1768454744 width=1560 height=1318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 5 Distinct Arenas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in three uniquely designed battlefields:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stadium: Splash ink across spaceships and planets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night City: Zip vertically through towering structures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pipe World: Dominate the winding interiors of massive pipes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/8c73186f57a8ddcf102dad7b6ec889f8.avif?t=1768454744\" width=1527 height=626 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/35a52679c2612185d2f3d4332f9b31c4.avif?t=1768454744\" width=1539 height=631 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/adc574a9e43b34cb78ab616642e29110.avif?t=1768454744\" width=1541 height=634 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/f76ed846be924d0c882a49ce92d84076.avif?t=1768454744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras_big/f76ed846be924d0c882a49ce92d84076.avif?t=1768454744 width=1560 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/dc1704c3035770fa74ab7c9b2a4abd33.avif?t=1768454744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras_big/dc1704c3035770fa74ab7c9b2a4abd33.avif?t=1768454744 width=1560 height=782 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 AI Battle Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice your skills or enjoy low-pressure matches by battling against AI bots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/93d1bd74bdbb60c516c3511604fba8d0.poster.avif?t=1768454744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/93d1bd74bdbb60c516c3511604fba8d0.webm?t=1768454744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/93d1bd74bdbb60c516c3511604fba8d0.mp4?t=1768454744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Customize Your Robot Pilot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into battle as a powerful robot pilot. Equip quirky and stylish hats to express your personality and stand out in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/84846004ec55bebd8e3743a9584433dc.avif?t=1768454744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras_big/84846004ec55bebd8e3743a9584433dc.avif?t=1768454744 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126470/extras/a1452b14f98529a289c09168938d740f.poster.avif?t=1768454744\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i